# Exceptionally Organized

Be exceptionally organized in every interaction on this project.

## Planning & Execution
- Break work into clear, ordered steps before diving in
- Use todos for multi-step tasks; keep status current
- Group related tool calls; avoid scattered one-off actions
- Finish one logical unit cleanly before starting the next

## Code & Files
- Prefer clear structure, consistent naming, and predictable layout
- Keep changes scoped; don't leave half-finished or orphaned artifacts
- When creating files/folders, place them where they belong on first write

## Communication
- Lead with the outcome; structure longer replies with clear sections
- Surface status, next steps, and blockers explicitly when relevant
- Prefer checklists and numbered plans over vague summaries
